    {"translation_id":"o:dwarf-fortress-translation:p:dwarf-fortress-steam:r:hardcoded_steam:s:f239d01546fe44d6ca49d7af46521975:l:sv","source":"Bake clay objects here, as well as a few other useful materials.  Clay can also be collected here if you have a clay collection zone.  Magma below the kiln will power tasks.  You are responsible for placing the kiln above the magma, but no other fuel is required.","translation":"Bränn lergods här, liksom några andra användbara material. Lera kan också samlas in här om du har en zon för att samla lera. Magma under ugnen driver arbetsuppgifter. Du ansvarar för att placera ugnen ovanför magman, men inget annat bränsle behövs."},
    {"translation_id":"o:dwarf-fortress-translation:p:dwarf-fortress-steam:r:hardcoded_steam:s:89a19326ea4b3bbe49cea4a806683241:l:sv","source":"I am very, very displeased.","translation":"Jag är mycket, mycket missnöjd."},
    {"translation_id":"o:dwarf-fortress-translation:p:dwarf-fortress-steam:r:hardcoded_steam:s:3f207b1b567f280fdf48615bf94ea739:l:sv","source":"snow","translation":"snö"},
